  Hall. With a beer garden\, kids’ zone\, and fun like chihuahua races an
 d bounce houses\, SalsaFest brings spicy excitement for all ages—making 
 it Safford’s signature weekend of food and fiesta.\n\nEvent website: htt
 ps://azsalsafest.com/\n\nVisit Arizona listing: https://www.visitarizona.c
 om/events/annual-salsafest
