DESCRIPTION:50K\, 24K\, 11K\, 5K - Celebrating 16 years\, the Cave Creek T
 hriller hosts four distances and acts as the first race of the Fall Desert
  Runner Trail Series. What began as a looped course within the Cave Creek 
 Regional Park years ago\, 50K runners will have the unique opportunity to 
 connect two regional parks in one day on the Maricopa Trail!\n\nEvent webs
 ite: https://www.aravaiparunning.com/drt-series/cave-creek-thriller/\n\nVi
 sit Arizona listing: https://www.visitarizona.com/events/cave-creek-thrill
 er
